"basketball": ["I play basketball after school.", "我放學後打籃球。", "What do you play with your friends?", "你和朋友玩什麼？", "We play basketball together.", "我們一起打籃球。"],
"bat": ["A bat sleeps in the day.", "蝙蝠白天睡覺。", "What animal flies at night?", "什麼動物晚上飛？", "A bat flies at night.", "蝙蝠晚上飛。"],
