"bathe": ["I bathe my dog on Sunday.", "我星期天幫狗洗澡。", "Who washes your dog?", "誰幫你的狗洗澡？", "I bathe him myself.", "我自己幫牠洗。"],
"bathroom": ["The bathroom is next to my room.", "浴室在我房間旁邊。", "Where do you brush your teeth?", "你在哪裡刷牙？", "I brush them in the bathroom.", "我在浴室刷牙。"],
"be": ["I want to be a teacher.", "我想當老師。", "What do you want to do in the future?", "你將來想做什麼？", "I want to be a cook.", "我想當廚師。"],
"beach": ["We play in the sand at the beach.", "我們在海灘玩沙。", "Where do you go in summer?", "你夏天去哪裡？", "We go to the beach.", "我們去海灘。"],
"bean": ["I plant a bean in a cup.", "我在杯子裡種一顆豆子。", "What did you plant?", "你種了什麼？", "I planted a small bean.", "我種了一顆小豆子。"],
"bear": ["The bear eats honey.", "熊吃蜂蜜。", "What animal do you like at the zoo?", "你在動物園喜歡什麼動物？", "I like the black bear.", "我喜歡黑熊。"],
"beard": ["My grandpa has a white beard.", "我爺爺有白鬍子。", "What does Santa look like?", "聖誕老公公長什麼樣子？", "He has a long white beard.", "他有長長的白鬍子。"],
"beat": ["Our team beat the other team.", "我們隊打敗了另一隊。", "Did your team win?", "你們隊贏了嗎？", "Yes, we beat them!", "是的，我們打敗他們了！"],
