"because": ["I stay home because it is raining.", "因為下雨，我待在家。", "Why do you like summer?", "你為什麼喜歡夏天？", "Because I can swim.", "因為我可以游泳。"],
"become": ["I want to become a doctor.", "我想成為醫生。", "What is your dream job?", "你的夢想工作是什麼？", "I want to become a chef.", "我想成為廚師。"],
"bed": ["I go to bed at nine.", "我九點上床睡覺。", "When do you sleep?", "你幾點睡覺？", "I go to bed at ten.", "我十點上床睡覺。"],
"bedroom": ["My bedroom is small and clean.", "我的臥室小而乾淨。", "Where do you do homework?", "你在哪裡寫功課？", "I do it in my bedroom.", "我在臥室寫。"],
"bee": ["A bee flies to the flower.", "一隻蜜蜂飛向花朵。", "What insect makes honey?", "什麼昆蟲會做蜂蜜？", "A bee makes honey.", "蜜蜂會做蜂蜜。"],
"beef": ["My dad cooks beef for dinner.", "爸爸晚餐煮牛肉。", "What do you want for lunch?", "你午餐想吃什麼？", "I want beef noodle soup.", "我想吃牛肉麵。"],
