"before": ["I wash my hands before dinner.", "我晚餐前洗手。", "When do you brush your teeth?", "你什麼時候刷牙？", "I brush them before bed.", "我睡前刷牙。"],
"begin": ["Class will begin at eight.", "八點開始上課。", "When does the movie start?", "電影什麼時候開始？", "It will begin at two.", "兩點開始。"],
"beginner": ["I am a beginner at piano.", "我是鋼琴初學者。", "Are you good at swimming?", "你很會游泳嗎？", "No, I am a beginner.", "不，我是初學者。"],
"beginning": ["I like the beginning of the story.", "我喜歡這個故事的開頭。", "Which part of the movie did you like?", "你喜歡電影的哪個部分？", "I liked the beginning.", "我喜歡開頭。"],
