"behind": ["The cat is behind the sofa.", "貓在沙發後面。", "Where is your ball?", "你的球在哪裡？", "It is behind the door.", "它在門後面。"],
"belief": ["It is my belief that hard work helps.", "我相信努力會有幫助。", "What do you think about practice?", "你覺得練習怎麼樣？", "My belief is that practice helps.", "我相信練習有幫助。"],
"believe": ["I believe you can do it.", "我相信你做得到。", "Can I finish this puzzle?", "我能完成這個拼圖嗎？", "Yes, I believe you can!", "可以，我相信你可以！"],
