"bench": ["We sit on a bench in the park.", "我們坐在公園的長椅上。", "Where do you eat lunch at school?", "你在學校哪裡吃午餐？", "I eat on a bench outside.", "我在外面的長椅上吃。"],
"beside": ["My friend sits beside me.", "我的朋友坐在我旁邊。", "Who sits next to you in class?", "上課時誰坐你旁邊？", "Amy sits beside me.", "艾咪坐我旁邊。"],
"besides": ["Besides math, I like science.", "除了數學，我也喜歡自然。", "What else do you like to eat?", "你還喜歡吃什麼？", "Besides rice, I like noodles.", "除了飯，我也喜歡麵。"],
"best": ["You are my best friend.", "你是我最好的朋友。", "What food do you like most?", "你最喜歡什麼食物？", "I like dumplings best.", "我最喜歡水餃。"],
"better": ["I feel better today.", "我今天感覺好多了。", "How is your cold?", "你的感冒怎麼樣了？", "I feel much better now.", "我現在好多了。"],
