"biology": ["We learn about plants in biology.", "我們在生物課學習植物。", "What is your favorite class?", "你最喜歡哪一堂課？", "I like biology best.", "我最喜歡生物。"],
"bird": ["A bird sings in the tree.", "一隻鳥在樹上唱歌。", "What is in the tree?", "樹上有什麼？", "There is a small bird.", "有一隻小鳥。"],
