"brunch": ["We eat brunch on Sunday.", "我們星期天吃早午餐。", "What do you eat late on Sunday morning?", "你星期天早上晚一點吃什麼？", "We have brunch at a cafe.", "我們在咖啡館吃早午餐。"],
