"buffet": ["We eat at a buffet on weekends.", "我們週末吃自助餐。", "Where did you eat dinner?", "你在哪裡吃晚餐？", "We ate at a buffet.", "我們去吃自助餐。"],
"bug": ["A little bug is on the leaf.", "一隻小蟲子在葉子上。", "What is on the window?", "窗戶上有什麼？", "There is a small bug.", "有一隻小蟲。"],
"build": ["We build a sand castle.", "我們堆沙堡。", "What do you do with blocks?", "你用積木做什麼？", "I build a tall tower.", "我蓋一座高塔。"],
"building": ["That building is very tall.", "那棟建築物很高。", "Where does your dad work?", "你爸爸在哪裡工作？", "He works in a big building.", "他在一棟大樓裡工作。"],
"bun": ["I eat a steamed bun for breakfast.", "我早餐吃一個包子。", "What do you buy at the breakfast shop?", "你在早餐店買什麼？", "I buy a pork bun.", "我買一個肉包。"],
"bundle": ["I carry a bundle of books.", "我抱著一捆書。", "What is in your arms?", "你手裡抱著什麼？", "It is a bundle of flowers.", "是一束花。"],
"burn": ["Be careful, hot soup can burn you.", "小心，熱湯會燙到你。", "Why do you wait for the soup?", "你為什麼等湯？", "It is hot and can burn my mouth.", "它很燙，會燙到我的嘴巴。"],
