"businessperson": ["My aunt is a businessperson.", "我阿姨是商人。", "What is your aunt's job?", "你阿姨的工作是什麼？", "She is a busy businessperson.", "她是一位忙碌的商人。"],
"busy": ["My mom is busy today.", "我媽媽今天很忙。", "Can you play now?", "你現在可以玩嗎？", "Sorry, I am busy now.", "抱歉，我現在很忙。"],
