"cage": ["The bird sings in its cage.", "小鳥在籠子裡唱歌。", "Where does your bird sleep?", "你的鳥睡在哪裡？", "It sleeps in a cage.", "牠睡在籠子裡。"],
"cake": ["I eat cake on my birthday.", "我生日時吃蛋糕。", "What dessert do you like?", "你喜歡什麼甜點？", "I like chocolate cake.", "我喜歡巧克力蛋糕。"],
"calendar": ["I mark my birthday on the calendar.", "我在日曆上標出我的生日。", "How do you remember the test day?", "你怎麼記得考試日期？", "I write it on my calendar.", "我寫在我的行事曆上。"],
