"careless": ["I was careless and lost my pen.", "我粗心弄丟了筆。", "Why did you get the answer wrong?", "你為什麼答錯？", "I was a little careless.", "我有點粗心。"],
"carpet": ["The cat sleeps on the carpet.", "貓睡在地毯上。", "What is on your bedroom floor?", "你臥室地板上有什麼？", "There is a soft carpet.", "有一張柔軟的地毯。"],
