"celebrate": ["We celebrate Chinese New Year with family.", "我們和家人一起慶祝農曆新年。", "What do you do at New Year?", "新年時你做什麼？", "We celebrate with a big dinner.", "我們吃一頓大餐來慶祝。"],
"cell": ["A cell is very small.", "細胞非常小。", "What do we see with a microscope?", "我們用顯微鏡看什麼？", "We can see a cell.", "我們可以看到細胞。"],
"cellphone": ["My mom has a new cellphone.", "我媽媽有一支新手機。", "How do you call your dad?", "你怎麼打電話給爸爸？", "I use my cellphone.", "我用我的手機。"],
"cent": ["One cent is a very small coin.", "一分錢是很小的硬幣。", "What is the smallest American coin?", "美國最小的硬幣是什麼？", "It is one cent.", "是一分錢。"],
