"century": ["This house is one century old.", "這棟房子有一百年了。", "How old is the temple?", "這座寺廟多老了？", "It is about one century old.", "大約一百年了。"],
"cereal": ["I eat cereal with milk.", "我吃麥片加牛奶。", "What do you eat for breakfast?", "你早餐吃什麼？", "I eat a bowl of cereal.", "我吃一碗麥片。"],
"certain": ["I am certain he will come.", "我確定他會來。", "Is the library open today?", "今天圖書館有開嗎？", "Yes, I am certain.", "是的，我很確定。"],
