"cheese": ["I like cheese on my pizza.", "我喜歡披薩上有起司。", "What do you put in your sandwich?", "你在三明治裡放什麼？", "I put cheese and ham.", "我放起司和火腿。"],
"chemical": ["Do not touch that chemical.", "不要碰那個化學製品。", "What is in that bottle?", "那個瓶子裡是什麼？", "It is a cleaning chemical.", "那是清潔用的化學品。"],
