"hamburger": ["I eat a hamburger for lunch.", "我午餐吃漢堡。", "What do you want for lunch?", "你午餐想吃什麼？", "I want a hamburger.", "我想吃漢堡。"],
"hammer": ["Dad uses a hammer to fix the chair.", "爸爸用鐵鎚修椅子。", "What does Dad need to fix the chair?", "爸爸修椅子需要什麼？", "He needs a hammer.", "他需要一把鐵鎚。"],
