"orange": ["I eat an orange every day.", "我每天吃一顆柳橙。", "What fruit do you like?", "你喜歡什麼水果？", "I like the orange.", "我喜歡柳橙。"],
"order": ["We order noodles at the shop.", "我們在店裡點麵。", "What do you want to eat?", "你想吃什麼？", "I want to order fried rice.", "我想點炒飯。"],
"ordinary": ["It was an ordinary day at school.", "那是學校裡普通的一天。", "Was today a special day?", "今天是特別的一天嗎？", "No, it was an ordinary day.", "不，那是普通的一天。"],
"organization": ["She works for a big organization.", "她在一個大組織工作。", "What group helps animals?", "什麼團體幫助動物？", "An organization helps them.", "一個組織幫助牠們。"],
