"oven": ["Mom bakes bread in the oven.", "媽媽用烤箱烤麵包。", "Where do you bake cookies?", "你在哪裡烤餅乾？", "I bake them in the oven.", "我用烤箱烤。"],
"over": ["A bird flew over our house.", "一隻鳥飛過我們的房子。", "Where is the lamp?", "燈在哪裡？", "It is over the table.", "它在桌子上方。"],
"overpass": ["We walk across the overpass.", "我們走過天橋。", "How do you cross the big road?", "你怎麼過那條大馬路？", "I use the overpass.", "我走天橋。"],
