"swim": ["I swim in the pool on Saturday.", "我星期六在游泳池游泳。", "What do you do in summer?", "你夏天做什麼？", "I swim with my brother.", "我和哥哥去游泳。"],
"swimsuit": ["I put on my swimsuit.", "我穿上泳衣。", "What do you wear in the pool?", "你在游泳池穿什麼？", "I wear a blue swimsuit.", "我穿藍色泳衣。"],
"swing": ["I swing my arms when I walk.", "我走路時擺動手臂。", "What do your arms do when you walk?", "你走路時手臂會怎麼樣？", "I swing them a little.", "我會稍微擺動它們。"],
