"teacher": ["My teacher is kind.", "我的老師很親切。", "Who helps you at school?", "在學校誰幫助你？", "My teacher helps me.", "我的老師幫助我。"],
"Teacher's Day": ["We give cards on Teacher's Day.", "我們在教師節送卡片。", "When do you thank your teachers?", "你什麼時候感謝老師？", "I thank them on Teacher's Day.", "我在教師節感謝他們。"],
