"theater": ["We watch a movie at the theater.", "我們在電影院看電影。", "Where do you watch movies?", "你在哪裡看電影？", "I watch them at the theater.", "我在電影院看。"],
"their": ["The children love their teacher.", "孩子們喜歡他們的老師。", "Whose dog is that?", "那是誰的狗？", "It is their dog.", "那是他們的狗。"],
