"truth": ["Always tell the truth.", "永遠要說實話。", "What should you tell your mom?", "你應該跟媽媽說什麼？", "I should tell the truth.", "我應該說實話。"],
"try": ["I try my best every day.", "我每天盡力而為。", "Can you eat this new food?", "你可以吃這個新食物嗎？", "I will try it.", "我會試試看。"],
"T-shirt": ["I wear a white T-shirt.", "我穿一件白色T恤。", "What do you wear in summer?", "你夏天穿什麼？", "I wear a cool T-shirt.", "我穿一件涼爽的T恤。"],
"tub": ["The baby plays in the tub.", "寶寶在浴缸裡玩。", "Where does the baby take a bath?", "寶寶在哪裡洗澡？", "She takes a bath in the tub.", "她在浴缸裡洗澡。"],
"Tuesday": ["I have PE on Tuesday.", "我星期二有體育課。", "When do you have PE class?", "你什麼時候上體育課？", "I have it on Tuesday.", "我星期二上。"],
"tunnel": ["The train goes into a long tunnel.", "火車開進一條長隧道。", "What is under the mountain?", "山底下有什麼？", "There is a long tunnel.", "有一條長隧道。"],
"turkey": ["We eat turkey at Thanksgiving.", "我們在感恩節吃火雞。", "What bird do Americans cook in November?", "美國人十一月煮什麼鳥？", "They cook a turkey.", "他們煮火雞。"],
