"turtle": ["The turtle walks slowly.", "烏龜走得很慢。", "What animal is very slow?", "什麼動物很慢？", "A turtle is very slow.", "烏龜很慢。"],
"TV": ["I watch TV after homework.", "我寫完作業後看電視。", "What do you do after homework?", "你寫完作業後做什麼？", "I watch TV with Dad.", "我和爸爸看電視。"],
