"twice": ["I brush my teeth twice a day.", "我一天刷兩次牙。", "How often do you brush your teeth?", "你多久刷一次牙？", "I brush them twice a day.", "我一天刷兩次。"],
"two": ["I have two eyes.", "我有兩隻眼睛。", "How many brothers do you have?", "你有幾個兄弟？", "I have two brothers.", "我有兩個兄弟。"],
"type": ["I type on the computer.", "我在電腦上打字。", "How do you write your report?", "你怎麼寫報告？", "I type it on my computer.", "我在電腦上打字。"],
"typhoon": ["We stay home during a typhoon.", "颱風時我們待在家裡。", "Why is there no school today?", "今天為什麼不用上學？", "There is a typhoon today.", "今天有颱風。"],
