"umbrella": ["I take an umbrella when it rains.", "下雨時我帶雨傘。", "What do you need on a rainy day?", "下雨天你需要什麼？", "I need an umbrella.", "我需要一把雨傘。"],
"uncle": ["My uncle lives in Tainan.", "我叔叔住在台南。", "Who is your dad's brother?", "你爸爸的弟弟是誰？", "He is my uncle.", "他是我叔叔。"],
"under": ["The cat sleeps under the table.", "貓睡在桌子下面。", "Where is your ball?", "你的球在哪裡？", "It is under the bed.", "在床底下。"],
"underline": ["Please underline the new words.", "請在新單字下面畫線。", "What should we do with new words?", "我們該怎麼處理新單字？", "We underline them in red.", "我們用紅筆在下面畫線。"],
"underpass": ["We walk through the underpass.", "我們走過地下道。", "How do you cross the big road?", "你怎麼過大馬路？", "I use the underpass.", "我走地下道。"],
"understand": ["I understand the question.", "我懂這個問題。", "Do you know this word?", "你知道這個字嗎？", "Yes, I understand it.", "知道，我懂。"],
