"uniform": ["I wear a uniform to school.", "我穿制服上學。", "What do you wear to school?", "你穿什麼上學？", "I wear my school uniform.", "我穿學校制服。"],
"unique": ["Every person is unique.", "每個人都是獨特的。", "Is your drawing like the others?", "你的畫和別人的一樣嗎？", "No, my drawing is unique.", "不，我的畫很獨特。"],
"unit": ["We finished Unit One today.", "我們今天上完了第一單元。", "What lesson are you on?", "你們上到哪一課？", "We are on Unit Five.", "我們在第五單元。"],
