"wolf": ["A wolf lives in the forest.", "狼住在森林裡。", "What animal looks like a big dog?", "什麼動物看起來像大狗？", "A wolf looks like a big dog.", "狼看起來像大狗。"],
"woman": ["The woman is my teacher.", "那位女士是我的老師。", "Who is that lady?", "那位女士是誰？", "That woman is my aunt.", "那位女士是我阿姨。"],
