"wonder": ["I wonder what is for dinner.", "我想知道晚餐吃什麼。", "What are you thinking about?", "你在想什麼？", "I wonder where my cat is.", "我在想我的貓在哪裡。"],
"wonderful": ["We had a wonderful day.", "我們度過了美好的一天。", "How was your trip?", "你的旅行怎麼樣？", "It was a wonderful trip!", "那是一趟很棒的旅行！"],
"wood": ["This table is made of wood.", "這張桌子是木頭做的。", "What is your chair made of?", "你的椅子是什麼做的？", "It is made of wood.", "是木頭做的。"],
"wooden": ["I have a wooden box.", "我有一個木盒子。", "What kind of spoon is that?", "那是什麼樣的湯匙？", "It is a wooden spoon.", "那是一支木湯匙。"],
