"worker": ["The worker fixes the road.", "工人修路。", "Who builds the house?", "誰蓋房子？", "A worker builds it.", "工人蓋的。"],
"world": ["I want to travel around the world.", "我想環遊世界。", "Where do you want to go someday?", "你有一天想去哪裡？", "I want to see the world.", "我想看看世界。"],
